#: scenario8:scenario8_00EE3401_D156_4593_B68D_2126DFE4922C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d447923531eaec8c069ec324fc06b350e8ae66eaa9e6dd412d176da55c1a498d
