msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫А? За что?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_81425D9D_08EF_4C8E_8353_599934E5B147
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 76906ea73187b1516eaf4f703e3ead2de6cb2551244794ac804e87e0afdbcdcd
